==Eengrish==

===Etymology===
First attested in 1432.  From {{etyl|enm}} {{term|topographye|lang=enm}} from {{etyl|la}} {{term|topographia|lang=la}}, from {{etyl|grc}} {{term|τοπογραφία||tr=topographia|lang=grc|sc=polytonic}} < {{term|τόπος||place|tr=topos|lang=grc|sc=polytonic}} + {{term|γράφω||I write|tr=graphō|lang=grc|sc=polytonic}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|RP}} {{IPA|/təˈpɒgɹəfi/}}, {{SAMPA|/t@"pQgr@fi/}}
* {{a|GenAm}} {{IPA|/təˈpɑgɹəfi/}}, {{SAMPA|/t@"pAgr@fi/}}
* {{hyphenation|top|og|raphy}}

